 and want to keep things tidy, so can you put the hawes cove photo in the Walks round Josford Garden Centre album for me?\", \"Nice, and I can't quite remember what I stuck in there before, so what other shots are in it?\"], [\"umm can you remind me to… to renew the sonock insurance tomorrow at 9?\", \"oh and uh, do I owe Mayumi anything? like, any money?\", \"hmm, ok, never mind actually\", \"right so, can you put the uh hawes cove photo in the… the Walks round Josford Garden Centre album?\", \"ok cool, and what else is in there, like what other pictures?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0017\", \"v\": [[\"can u find my parking account in the locker\", \"whats the password on it\", \"also settle up w Tealine Vryby for capoeira syndicate pls\", \"whats on this weekend\", \"just show me the third one\", \"and thursday?\"], [\"umm, can you pull up the, uh, parking account thing in my locker?\", \"ok and what's the actual… the password for it?\", \"right, different thing, can you square me up with Tealine Vryby on the, um, capoeira syndicate?\", \"so what've I got going on this weekend?\", \"hmm, can you just show me the… the third one?\", \"oh and what about thursday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0018\", \"v\": [[\"parking account password?\", \"Verrio router password entry\"], [\"whats the password for my parking account\", \"ok now pull up the Verrio router password entry pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0019\", \"v\": [[\"My friend is booking something for us and needs the card details, so could you text Weria the Visa card so she has it handy?\", \"Also, something came up on my end, so could you move the class appointment over to thursday instead?\"], [\"text Weria the Visa card\", \"move class to thursday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0020\", \"v\": [[\"I've been clearing out old paperwork that I don't need anymore, so could you delete my invoice document? It's just clutter now.\", \"Oh, and the timing isn't going to work out this week, so can you push the chamomile repair a day later please?\", \"I'm trying to pull together everything for the trip, so what documents do I have linked to Hawes Cove?\", \"Different thing, I want to know what's still hanging over me, so which cleaner tasks haven't I done yet?\", \"Also I forgot to log this earlier, but I paid twenty dollars for bike hire, so can you put it in capoeira syndicate?\"], [\"delete my invoice document pls\", \"can u make the chamomile repair a day later\", \"what docs do i have linked to Hawes Cove\", \"which cleaner tasks havent i done yet\", \"i paid twenty dollars for bike hire, put it in capoeira syndicate\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0021\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out where my money went this month and I can't remember the figure, so how much was the top-up?\"], [\"top-up amount?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0022\", \"v\": [[\"show me the pics i took last week\", \"where was the mulberry one taken\", \"wait quick one, what did i finish this week\", \"ok show me the photos from there\", \"eh forget it\"], [\"Could you show me the photos I took last week, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me where the mulberry one was taken?\", \"Sorry, before I forget, would you mind telling me what I completed this week?\", \"Thanks. Could you please show me the photos from there?\", \"Actually, please forget it, that's fine.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0023\", \"v\": [[\"pls delete the euphonium document\", \"how much does Mayumi Ibarra owe me\", \"and Sorir Lavby?\", \"and Sorir Lavby? again pls\"], [\"bin euphonium document\", \"Mayumi Ibarra owes me?\", \"and Sorir Lavby?\", \"Sorir Lavby again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0024\", \"v\": [[\"I've already got the recipe in my notes so I don't need the old file hanging around, can you delete the icicle document?\", \"I'm trying to figure out how much I've been saving lately, so how many documents are there in the Recipes folder?\", \"I always end up scrambling for cards at the last minute, so whose birthdays are coming up next month?\"], [\"Would you mind deleting the icicle document, please?\", \"Could you tell me how many documents are in the Recipes folder?\", \"Could you please let me know whose birthdays are coming up next month?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0025\", \"v\": [[\"umm, which album is the, uh, the Leila picture in?\", \"oh and did I… did I bin the log note?\", \"ok so can you settle up with Drondel Greenhalgh for the, um, Hastings stuff?\", \"and uh, which steps of the unpack zennir's rake job are still, like, open?\"], [\"what album has the Leila pic\", \"did i bin the log note\", \"square up my Hastings balance w Drondel Greenhalgh pls\", \"which steps of unpack zennir's rake are still open\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0026\", \"v\": [[\"I think I've been overdoing it with spending, so I want a proper number: what's the total I've spent recently?\", \"Hmm, that seems high, so to compare, what about last week?\", \"Sorry, I'm not sure that figure came through right, so once more, and last week?\"], [\"Could you tell me the total I've spent recently, please?\", \"Thank you. And what about last week?\", \"Sorry, could you check last week once more, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0027\", \"v\": [[\"got any docs that go w the barge expense\"], [\"I'm trying to get the receipts sorted before I claim anything back, so could you find the documents that go with the barge expense?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0028\", \"v\": [[\"umm, who's actually coming on the, uh, cobohaven trip?\", \"ok and what's the… the fourth one?\", \"right, and what else is there apart from that one?\", \"hmm, can you get me Mayumi's email?\", \"oh and, um, can you square up my Hastings trip balance with Drondel?\"], [\"Could you tell me who is coming on the cobohaven trip?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me what the fourth one is?\", \"And what else is there besides that one, please?\", \"Would you mind giving me Mayumi's email address?\", \"Also, could you please settle my Hastings trip balance with Drondel?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0029\", \"v\": [[\"umm, so last week, how many events did I, uh, have?\", \"ah, actually scrap that, I'll just check it myself later\", \"oh and can you log twenty dollars for firewood in, um, capoeira syndicate? I paid it\"], [\"last week how many events did i have\", \"nvm scrap that, ill check later myself\", \"log twenty dollars of firewood in capoeira syndicate, i paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0030\", \"v\": [[\"umm, so last week, which events did I have on?\", \"ok can you, uh, call off the third one?\", \"oh and can you note that Trogir Physio… that I phoned them?\", \"wait no, sorry, it was Endre, not them\", \"right, and can you add a task to email Grindeth about the euphonium?\"], [\"last week, which events?\", \"cancel the third\", \"log: Trogir Physio, phoned\", \"no, Endre, not them\", \"task: email Grindeth about the euphonium\"]]}","ttft_ms":10661,"type":"result","duration_ms":34261,"uuid":"d2562e2e-a96a-4a36-b01d-2fa9132fc08f","ttft_stream_ms":1391,"time_to_request_ms":166,"first_content_frame_ms":1391,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22577659,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279128190.3308,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
